### Additional Information Requested

Please provide the following artifacts before the design workshop:

* Network topology diagram
* Internet breakout architecture
* Firewall topology
* IP addressing scheme
* Existing proxy configuration
* PAC file (if applicable)
* VPN topology
* Identity architecture
* List of internal applications
* Public IP inventory
* Existing security architecture
* DNS architecture
* SSL certificate details
* List of business-critical applications

This expanded questionnaire aligns well with Cisco Secure Access (SSE) design workshops and typically captures nearly all of the information needed to design services such as Secure Web Gateway (SWG), Zero Trust Network Access (ZTNA), Firewall-as-a-Service (FWaaS), Remote Browser Isolation (RBI), DNS-layer security, and Data Loss Prevention (DLP) while minimizing follow-up discovery sessions.

